{
  "displayName": "Gemini Enterprise Overview",
  "mosaicLayout": {
    "columns": 48,
    "tiles": [
      {
        "width": 48,
        "height": 4,
        "widget": {
          "text": {
            "content": "## Gemini Enterprise Overview\n\nRequest volume, latency and connector health of your Gemini Enterprise apps, built from the native\n`discoveryengine.googleapis.com` metrics ([metric reference](https://docs.cloud.google.com/gemini/enterprise/docs/access-metrics)). App-level engine metrics are\ncollected for every app; agent and data connector metrics require **Enable instrumentation of OpenTelemetry\ntraces and logs** in the app's [observability settings](https://docs.cloud.google.com/gemini/enterprise/docs/manage-observability-settings). These metrics are in Beta and\nretained for six weeks.",
            "format": "MARKDOWN",
            "style": {
              "backgroundColor": "#FFFFFF",
              "textColor": "#212121",
              "fontSize": "FS_LARGE",
              "horizontalAlignment": "H_LEFT",
              "verticalAlignment": "V_TOP",
              "padding": "P_EXTRA_SMALL"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "yPos": 4,
        "width": 8,
        "height": 4,
        "widget": {
          "title": "Assistant requests",
          "scorecard": {
            "timeSeriesQuery": {
              "timeSeriesFilter": {
                "filter": "metric.type=\"discoveryengine.googleapis.com/engine/request_count\" resource.type=\"discoveryengine.googleapis.com/Engine\" metric.label.\"method\"=monitoring.regex.full_match(\".*StreamAssist\")",
                "aggregation": {
                  "alignmentPeriod": "3600s",
                  "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_DELTA",
                  "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_SUM"
                }
              }
            },
            "sparkChartView": {
              "sparkChartType": "SPARK_BAR"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "xPos": 8,
        "yPos": 4,
        "width": 8,
        "height": 4,
        "widget": {
          "title": "Assistant requests not 2xx",
          "scorecard": {
            "timeSeriesQuery": {
              "timeSeriesFilter": {
                "filter": "metric.type=\"discoveryengine.googleapis.com/engine/request_count\" resource.type=\"discoveryengine.googleapis.com/Engine\" metric.label.\"method\"=monitoring.regex.full_match(\".*StreamAssist\") metric.label.\"response_code_class\"!=\"2xx\"",
                "aggregation": {
                  "alignmentPeriod": "3600s",
                  "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_DELTA",
                  "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_SUM"
                }
              }
            },
            "sparkChartView": {
              "sparkChartType": "SPARK_BAR"
            },
            "thresholds": [
              {
                "value": 1,
                "color": "YELLOW",
                "direction": "ABOVE"
              },
              {
                "value": 10,
                "color": "RED",
                "direction": "ABOVE"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "xPos": 16,
        "yPos": 4,
        "width": 8,
        "height": 4,
        "widget": {
          "title": "p50 assistant latency",
          "scorecard": {
            "timeSeriesQuery": {
              "timeSeriesFilter": {
                "filter": "metric.type=\"discoveryengine.googleapis.com/engine/request_total_latency\" resource.type=\"discoveryengine.googleapis.com/Engine\" metric.label.\"method\"=monitoring.regex.full_match(\".*StreamAssist\")",
                "aggregation": {
                  "alignmentPeriod": "3600s",
                  "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_DELTA",
                  "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_PERCENTILE_50"
                }
              },
              "unitOverride": "ms"
            },
            "sparkChartView": {
              "sparkChartType": "SPARK_LINE"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "xPos": 24,
        "yPos": 4,
        "width": 8,
        "height": 4,
